WEBVTT

00:09:27.771 --> 00:09:31.317
In the United States, in the 1950s,
the top rate of tax was 90 percent.

00:09:31.775 --> 00:09:33.485
Today, it's 37 percent.

00:09:34.194 --> 00:09:36.989
In the UK, for much
of Margaret Thatcher's premiership,

00:09:37.031 --> 00:09:39.366
the top rate of tax was 60 percent.

00:09:39.408 --> 00:09:41.118
Today, it's 45 percent.

00:09:41.160 --> 00:09:45.664
Dwight Eisenhower and the Iron Lady --
hardly two radical Marxists.

00:09:46.582 --> 00:09:49.752
And then, there's things
like financial transactions tax.

00:09:49.752 --> 00:09:52.212
All the outrage, in fact,

00:09:52.254 --> 00:09:56.759
that we tax work more than we tax wealth,

00:09:56.759 --> 00:09:58.177
which is astonishing.

00:09:58.218 --> 00:09:59.386
In the UK and the US,

00:09:59.386 --> 00:10:01.764
capital gains are taxed
lower than incomes.